## Pipeline history
- G0: 2026-05-23 — drafted from Carter, 20 Strategies Collection (H1)

## Implementation Notes for Codex (P1)
- Check all 4 TFs using `iClose(NULL,PERIOD_M5,1)>iOpen(NULL,PERIOD_M5,1)` etc.
- MT5 multi-TF data: ensure `CopyRates` or direct iClose/iOpen is called per-TF; MT5 loads lower-TF data independently
- Confirmation: `Ask - iClose(NULL,PERIOD_H1,1) > 30*Point` for long (30 points = 3 pips on 5-decimal)
- Doji filter: `MathAbs(iClose(NULL,PERIOD_H1,1) - iOpen(NULL,PERIOD_H1,1)) < 10*Point` → skip
- P3 sweeps: confirmation buffer (1/3/5 pips), SL (15/20/25 pips), TP (25/35/45 pips), TF set (add/remove M5)

